    "assumptions": [
      "Standard finite-dimensional convex-hull compression is available.",
      "The previously accepted private-message row formulation and its optimization order remain valid.",
      "These facts apply only to finite posterior meshes and finite receiver alphabets; they do not justify a continuum limit, a uniform continuum cardinality bound, or unrestricted functional symmetrization."
    ],
